   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Au restaurant avec la famille.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ພໍ່ສົມສັກ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ກິນໃຫ້ອີ່ມເດີ!</span><span class=\"rom\">Kǐn hây ìim dɤ̌ɤ!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ອາຫານແຊບຫຼາຍໆ</span><span class=\"rom\">Ǎa-hǎan sɛ̂ɛp lǎay-lǎay.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ພໍ່ສົມສັກ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ເອົານ້ຳເພີ່ມບໍ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Ǎo nȁam phɤ̄ɤm bɔ̌ɔ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ ອີ່ມແລ້ວ</span><span class=\"rom\">Bɔ̀ɔ pěn nyǎng, ìim lɛ̏ɛw.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ພໍ່ສົມສັກ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ນ້ອງ ໄລ່ເງິນແດ່!</span><span class=\"rom\">Nɔ̏ɔng, lāy-ngɤ́n dɛ̀ɛ!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂອບໃຈຫຼາຍໆພໍ່</span><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̏ɔp-jǎy lǎay-lǎay phɔ̄ɔ.</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>M. Somsak</b> — Mangez bien !<br><b>Clara</b> — La nourriture est vraiment bonne.<br><b>M. Somsak</b> — Tu veux plus d&#x27;eau ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Non merci, je suis rassasiée.<br><b>M. Somsak</b> — S&#x27;il vous plaît, l&#x27;addition !<br><b>Clara</b> — Merci beaucoup, monsieur.</p></details>"
